            <div xml:id="d1060">

                <pb facs="0906" n="790" xml:id="pg790"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/3602.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-15T21:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 15, 1912—9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s April 14, 3 p.m., has produced a deep but confusing effect upon
                    public mind. It is not generally understood and is variously construed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
